{"id":"n74415-1-11","stage":5,"title":"전등 · 电灯","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74415-1-11-1","ko":"화장실 전등 스위치가 어디에 있는지 모르겠어.","zh":"我不知道卫生间的灯开关在哪儿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"화장실","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전등","meaning":"电灯","explanation":"전등：电灯","readings":[{"term":"전등","audio":"/audio/4981558695b3e038ca74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74415","senseId":"1","lemma":"전등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스위치가","meaning":"开关","explanation":"스위치：开关；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"스위치","audio":"/audio/27409973983370361dde.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15829","senseId":"1","lemma":"스위치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"4981558695b3e038","term":"전등","zh":"电灯","audio":"/audio/4981558695b3e038ca74.mp3","entryId":"74415","definition":"用电照明的灯。","pronunciation":["전ː등"]},{"id":"2740997398337036","term":"스위치","zh":"开关","audio":"/audio/27409973983370361dde.mp3","entryId":"15829","definition":"接通和截断电路的设备。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2417afceeded190054c6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74415-1-11-2","ko":"따로 켤 필요 없이 사람이 들어가면 저절로 켜져.","zh":"不需要另外开关，有人进去的话灯就会自动亮起来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"따로","meaning":"分开，单独","explanation":"따로：分开，单独","readings":[{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49672","senseId":"1","lemma":"따로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"켤","meaning":"打开，发动","explanation":"켜다：打开，发动；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"켜다","audio":"/audio/c21cbaed08b52b5bb6d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72168","senseId":"2","lemma":"켜다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"필요","meaning":"必要，需要","explanation":"필요：必要，需要","readings":[{"term":"필요","audio":"/audio/3ceb8b2c14a13750c453.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72405","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없이","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없이：没有","readings":[{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89918","senseId":"1","lemma":"없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{